      "id": 1,
      "text": "Levinsky Market stretches five blocks and reflects eighty years of immigration history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://harrysbaked.com/levinsky-market-guide/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The market’s name honors Elhanan Leib Levinsky, a Jewish‑Russian writer and early Zionist thinker.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://harrysbaked.com/levinsky-market-guide/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Founded by Salonika Jews in the 1920s, Levinsky Market introduced bourekas, spices, and Balkan food traditions to Tel Aviv.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://harrysbaked.com/levinsky-market-guide/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cafe Atlas, opened in 1924 by Salonika immigrants, remains the market’s oldest continuously operating business.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://harrysbaked.com/levinsky-market-guide/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Puni Bakery, started in 1922 by Polish immigrants, is one of Israel’s oldest bakeries and still sells traditional pastries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://harrysbaked.com/levinsky-market-guide/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The surrounding Florentin neighborhood was designed by architect Yosef Tishler with a menorah‑shaped street plan.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
